<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 21 个信源（18 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:40:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Qwen Code SDK TypeScript 版 v0.1.39 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.39</link><description>Qwen Code 的 TypeScript SDK 发布 v0.1.39，一次打包了 0.28.7 与 0.28.6 两个 CLI 版本，方便开发者直接以 SDK 方式集成调用。</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:06:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4525f9a7e8d835d35133a2a64ef23f7cd4964220</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.39">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.6 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.6</link><description>托管会话现在可在等待工具审批、提问或 Hooks/MCP 决策时挂起，即使 Harness 重启也能通过冷恢复继续执行。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:55:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b3a5ecb86fe232470585f10d3f85236c4726ca44</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.6">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.7 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.7</link><description>Qwen Code CLI 登陆 Harness 内核，用量统计默认关闭，重复工具调用被拒时会给出更清楚的说明。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:08:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a1411dc283e3ca5ac44554c0991e7e0b2e266426</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.7">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code SDK TypeScript v0.1.36 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.36</link><description>Qwen Code 的 TypeScript SDK 发布 v0.1.36，内置 CLI 0.28.6，方便开发者直接在项目里调用 Qwen Code 的能力。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:46:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b918abbae4eccac48ab9b3dfc0679c4f84e2526a</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.36">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.76.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.76.0</link><description>实时会话可在进行中向模型揭示新工具，Gemini 2.5 Pro/Flash 开始报弃用警告，Pax 新增电脑操作桌面沙箱。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:49:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">55838b19d9bbb27a48a2a9fbd363fe9b945fd432</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.76.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Hugging Face 在 AWS Trainium3 上跑通 LTX-2.5 视频生成，10 秒成片约 22 秒</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/video-trainium3</link><description>Hugging Face 用张量并行加序列并行把 LTX-2.5 搬上 AWS Trainium3，半台机器 22 秒左右就能生成一段 10 秒、带声音的 2048×1024 视频，速度追平官方付费 API，还顺手搭了一套按分镜串联短片的工作流。</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2d7f8b4f8454af3138b975bc7f8d7a019ddb5d13</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/video-trainium3">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenCode v2.4.2 发布</title><link>https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.2</link><description>开源 AI 编程智能体 OpenCode 发布 v2.4.2 维护版本，本次未附详细更新说明。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:37:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0c5213ef953e1b494d249e22f829c22fb597f78e</guid><source url="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.2">OpenCode Releases</source></item><item><title>SDK v0.2.2</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fsdk%2Fv0.2.2</link><description>Cline SDK v0.2.2 发布，清理内部遥测代码，精简相关导出与依赖。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:40:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bc0403b660896832134ba9c9fcbe482244d6a315</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fsdk%2Fv0.2.2">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Cline 桌面版 v0.0.51</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/desktop-v0.0.51</link><description>Cline 桌面应用发布 v0.0.51 维护版本。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:34:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ffe2cb9ed2c316c594497776defd7b5b9a31c734</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/desktop-v0.0.51">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Cline v4.1.28 发布</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/v4.1.28</link><description>Cline 发布 v4.1.28，刷新模型目录，OpenAI 供应商不再列出上游已标记废弃的模型编号。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:57:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6aa9757abc1bc016b6394f6668dbff50b8f32995</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/v4.1.28">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Cline CLI v3.0.76</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/cli-v3.0.76</link><description>Cline CLI v3.0.76 在 npm 包根目录统一附带一份覆盖全部平台二进制文件的第三方声明，内置模型目录同步刷新，OpenAI 选择器不再显示上游已下架的模型。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:56:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4f717990edd7c87a863e2d900858d943d10fbd52</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/cli-v3.0.76">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>用开发者交给 Kiro 的真实工作评测编程智能体</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/kirobench</link><description>Kiro 公开了内部评测集 KiroBench：300 多道任务取自亚马逊工程师的真实开发工作，覆盖功能开发、修 Bug、重构等多轮场景，用可运行环境加验证器打分，以避开公开基准的题目泄露与覆盖面过窄问题。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3e370caedb76941d16ca9046cae2261c291d1dba</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/kirobench">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>基于 Nemotron 3.5 Parse 构建：开放数据、微调与更快推理</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/building-on-nemotron-35-parse-open-data-fine-tunin</link><description>英伟达文档解析模型 Nemotron 3.5 Parse 的实战分享：公开训练数据、微调方法与推理加速，帮开发者把文档解析接到自己的流程里。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:05:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d3aa48daa62df5852a1b067eacae1265bc9a1872</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/building-on-nemotron-35-parse-open-data-fine-tunin">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>llama.cpp 基准看板上线，覆盖 AMD Ryzen 与 Radeon</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/ggml-org/llamacpp-amd-bench</link><description>Hugging Face 上线公开看板，可按硬件、模型与量化方式对比 llama.cpp 在 AMD Ryzen 和 Radeon 上的提示处理与生成速度，并追踪各版本的性能变化。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:37:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">02a088434703556c0ebb46d05bae744860572362</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/ggml-org/llamacpp-amd-bench">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Copilot 代码审查计费将默认由组织承担</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization</link><description>还没给持证成员的 Copilot 代码审查选定计费方式的话，从 2026 年 12 月 30 日起这笔费用将自动记到组织账上。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:18:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c0d40e212e2d59484e972522a09228f837cc2503</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item></channel></rss>
